use firn/tags

wine is a Module
wine is tagged gaming

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.wine.enable
    "environment"
      "systemPackages": [pkgs.wineWowPackages.unstable, pkgs.unstable.winetricks]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."wine"."enable": enable "Wine (unstable, 32+64-bit)"
